[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461478315","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98743#issuecomment-2461478315","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98743","id":2461478315,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Sty2r","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T07:10:01Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T07:10:01Z","body":"When matching `fr_CH` from `[\"fr\", \"fr_CA\"]`, `fr` is correctly picked.\r\n\r\nWhen matching `zh_HK` from `[\"zh\", \"zh_CN\"]`, both these two options score 3, which is not expected.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2461478315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2462200256","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98743#issuecomment-2462200256","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98743","id":2462200256,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SwjHA","user":{"login":"dbnicholson","id":6495518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTU1MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6495518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson","html_url":"https://github.com/dbnicholson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T13:09:28Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T13:09:28Z","body":"> When matching `zh_HK` from `[\"zh\", \"zh_CN\"]`, both these two options score 3, which is not expected.\r\n\r\nWow, that is very unusual. It's because of the [this part](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/87318a2fb7fffeb72adca934e31915be077c3d1f/core/string/translation_server.cpp#L186) that sets the script and/or country when comparing locales:\r\n\r\n* `zh_HK` -> `zh_Hant_HK`\r\n* `zh` -> `zh_Hans_CN`\r\n* `zh_CN` -> `zh_Hans_CN`\r\n\r\nIn other words, `zh` is equivalent to `zh_CN` and the score gets deducted by 2 because both the script and country mismatch. I'll add test cases with comments for that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2462200256/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2462224995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98743#issuecomment-2462224995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98743","id":2462224995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SwpJj","user":{"login":"dbnicholson","id":6495518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTU1MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6495518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson","html_url":"https://github.com/dbnicholson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-07T13:20:24Z","updated_at":"2024-11-07T13:20:24Z","body":"I added test cases for `zh-HK` vs `zh-CN` and `zh-CN` vs `zh`. I also fleshed out the test comments a bit more for why the scores are the way they are. It would be nice if you could call `standardize_locale` with the defaults added outside of `TranslationServer`, but that's a separate issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2462224995/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2470488185","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98743#issuecomment-2470488185","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98743","id":2470488185,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TQKh5","user":{"login":"dbnicholson","id":6495518,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0OTU1MTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6495518?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson","html_url":"https://github.com/dbnicholson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbnicholson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T13:08:30Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T13:08:30Z","body":"> It would be nice if you could call `standardize_locale` with the defaults added outside of `TranslationServer`, but that's a separate issue.\r\n\r\n#98972 addresses that (and will likely cause a conflict with this if merged).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2470488185/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2470870276","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/98743#issuecomment-24708702